<h2>Onion export pricing</h2>
<p>Onion prices are volatile even by fresh-produce standards — domestic Indian market prices, harvest timing, and government policy interventions all move them. Send your grade, quantity and destination port and we'll quote current terms with a short validity window and confirmation of any policy conditions that apply.</p>
